(58, 'predefined_terms_invoice', 'Terms & Conditions:\r\n\r\nThis invoice is payable within 15 days from the date of issue unless otherwise specified.\r\n\r\nDelayed payments may attract interest, penalties, or suspension of services at the discretion of Dealplex.\r\n\r\nAll payments made are non-refundable unless explicitly agreed in writing by Dealplex.\r\n\r\nAny discrepancies in this invoice must be reported within 7 days from the invoice date.\r\n\r\nTaxes, including GST, are charged as per prevailing government regulations and are mandatory.\r\n\r\nThis invoice supersedes all prior communications related to the billed services/products.\r\n\r\nDealplex shall not be liable for delays or failures caused by factors beyond its reasonable control.\r\n\r\nAny disputes arising from this invoice shall be subject to the jurisdiction applicable to Payplex Technologies registered office.\r\n\r\nThis is a system-generated invoice and does not require a physical signature.', 1),
(59, 'predefined_terms_estimate', 'Terms & Conditions:\r\n\r\nThis estimate is valid for 7 days from the date of issue unless stated otherwise.\r\n\r\nAcceptance of this estimate confirms agreement to pricing, scope, and delivery terms mentioned herein.\r\n\r\nFinal invoice values may vary due to changes in scope, taxes, government charges, or service conditions.\r\n\r\nThis estimate does not constitute a tax invoice or receipt.\r\n\r\nDealplex reserves the right to revise or withdraw this estimate before acceptance.\r\n\r\nAll applicable taxes, including GST, will be charged as per prevailing government regulations.\r\n\r\nAny disputes arising from this estimate shall be subject to the jurisdiction applicable to Dealplex’s registered office.\r\n\r\nThis is a system-generated document and does not require a physical signature.', 1),
