(1, '[task_attachment]', 10, 8, 0, 64, '2026-01-11 05:10:29'),
(2, '<p>? allready explain about this.</p>', 29, 1, 0, 0, '2026-02-05 18:55:37'),
(3, '<p>need the local access also don\'t know how long it takes to complete the task as this was an lengthy and hard framework.</p>', 29, 7, 0, 0, '2026-02-05 19:24:03'),
(4, '<p>Generated Invoices for APPAREL ROUTE PRIVATE LIMITED, Lucidus private limited, Buslin fresh appliance &amp; LUMINARK TECHNOLOGY PRIVATE LIMITED awaiting for approval or if any changes required.</p>', 55, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-08 18:56:54'),
(5, '<p>Documents Generated Invoices for APPAREL ROUTE PRIVATE LIMITED, Lucidus private limited, Buslin fresh appliance &amp; LUMINARK TECHNOLOGY PRIVATE LIMITED&#160;</p>', 55, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-10 11:58:08'),
(6, '[task_attachment]', 55, 1, 0, 256, '2026-07-10 11:59:46'),
(7, '[task_attachment]', 55, 1, 0, 257, '2026-07-10 11:59:46'),
(8, '[task_attachment]', 55, 1, 0, 258, '2026-07-10 11:59:46'),
(9, '[task_attachment]', 55, 1, 0, 259, '2026-07-10 11:59:46'),
(10, '<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"639\" style=\"height:120px;border-collapse:collapse;width:479.27pt;\"><colgroup><col width=\"639\" style=\"width:479.95pt;\"> </colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height:90pt;\">\n<td class=\"et3\" style=\"height:90pt;width:479.95pt;\">Follow up with Client &amp; Troubleshooting (CBS RD/FD Error)<span class=\"font2\"><br>Details: Conducted a Google Meet call with the client today to investigate an error message in the CBS panel. The error occurs when attempting to process a matured RD/FD payout (either via transfer to the customer\'s savings account or cash payment). Due to this error, Client is unable to approve the transaction voucher.<br>Pending further investigation / Escalated to IT for technical review and follow up did.</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>', 57, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-14 19:00:38'),
(11, '<p>15/07/2026</p>\n<p>Followed up with the IT team regarding an approval failure. The system prevents voucher verification when moving matured RD/FD proceeds to a savings account (applies to both cash and direct transfer options).</p>\n<p>Client Update -</p>\n<p>1) As referred to our relevant team Contacted the client (Radha Kanta) to inform that the loan section currently does not support functionality without an EMI option. Advised the client that we are actively working on implementing this feature. Also, regarding 2nd query we will get back to him as awaiting for a response from our IT team.<br>2) Outbound call to Payplex client - To inform them that currently only UPI and ATM services are operational - No response / Call not answered.</p>\n<p>Checked information about - Create Loan Cycle &amp; Designation Access Permissions</p>', 57, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-16 15:04:03'),
(12, '<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Task for 16/07/2026 by Shweta Lakra</span></p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>1) Customer contacted and reported the following</span><span> </span><span>new Issues and Enhancement Requests for CBS Payplex Portal, </span><span>bugs, restrictions, and feature requests within the CBS Payplex portal that require resolution or modification:</span></p>\n<p><b>&#160;</b></p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>RD/FD Payout Voucher Approval Failure</span><span> </span><span>- </span><span>Vouchers cannot be approved when transferring funds from an RD/FD account to a member\'s savings account (applies to both cash and transfer transactions). Requirement: Resolve the approval blocking and make the payout process flexible.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Membership Update Restrictions (Guardian Details)</span><span> - </span><span>The system currently mandates filling out a Guardian Member ID and Name for all members (both adults and minors). Requirement: Adjust the validation rules so that guardian details are strictly compulsory only for minors up to 10 years of age.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Phone Number Reusability Limit</span><span> </span><span>- </span><span>A phone number cannot be linked to more than one member account. Requirement: Allow a single phone number to be associated with up to 3 different member accounts.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Joint Account Member Limit</span><span> - </span><span>The joint account creation module currently restricts the account to a maximum of 2 members. Requirement: Increase the limit or add an option to include up to 3 members in a joint account.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Dedicated Savings Account Update Module</span><span> - </span><span>Requirement: Create a distinct, separate menu option specifically for updating Savings Accounts.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Loan Account Type Flexibilities</span><span> - </span><span>System restrictions prevent successful account creation depending on EMI configurations. Requirement: Fix the loan account creation process to seamlessly support both \"With EMI\" and \"Without EMI\" structures.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Collector Creation Missing</span><span> - </span><span>Users are currently unable to create collector profiles. Requirement: Implement a feature/option that allows for the creation and setup of a collector name.</span><b></b></p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span>2) Manually Tested/checked on every single issue</span><span> </span><span>on the portal provided by Client and escalated to our IT team. Also, following up on the previous query, the IT team advised that there is some calculation issue so will take time to solve and will check new issues as well and update as soon as possible.</span></p>\n<p><span>3) Contacted Payplex Client&#160;</span><span>(</span><span>K2S Financial Services PVT LTD</span><span>) informed which services currently are operational. Also, the client asked what the status of the QR as client already discussed with Anand Sir, advised we will check and get back.</span></p>\n<p></p>', 57, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-17 10:18:34'),
(13, '<p>Task done for 23/07/2026</p>\n<p>1) Call with Sunil Sir received update on CBS Techplex technical issue. Monitoring status while technical team works on a fix.<br>2) Reached out to the client Radha Kanta (Techplex) to let them know the issue is currently being handled by the IT team and will take some time to resolve. I am following up closely with IT and will provide regular updates to the client as progress is made.<br>3) Client Praveen Sir (Payplex) Contacted enquiry about ITR, advised Siddharth sir will contact him.<br>4) Added new product items to the DealPlex portal for B2B, including product details, descriptions, images, and category mapping.</p>', 61, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-23 19:08:58'),
(14, '<p>1) CBS Techplex study Activity Log:<br>a. Transaction Reports: Allows auditing of all organizational financial flows (deposits, withdrawals, loan disbursements, and repayments). Enables status tracking (successful/pending/failed), daily ledger reconciliation, and regulatory report generation.<br>b. Product-Wise Branch Reports: Provides comprehensive visibility into SB, CA, RD, FD, Pigmy, MIS, Shares, OD, LD, and Pigmy withdrawals. Features include deposit/withdrawal summaries, account statements, interest calculation reports, and maturity tracking.<br>c. General Branch Collections: Located under - Branch Report - General. Enables viewing of individual Employee/Agent Daily Collection Reports as well as consolidated Branch Collection Reports.<br>2) Payplex Client Update: Praveen reached out to discuss ITR with sir. Update shared with Siddharth sir&#8212;he will be picking up this task.</p>', 61, 1, 0, 0, '2026-07-24 19:04:37'),
(15, '<p>a)Followed up with 1 client (Radha Kanta) regarding ongoing IT issues (technical issue acknowledged; shared revised timeline).<br>b) Contacted 2 clients to request domain details as website deployment - Received details from one client shared with Sir.<br>c) Completed daily product training and knowledge enhancement activities.</p>', 62, 22, 0, 0, '2026-07-27 19:00:40'),
(16, '<p>29/07/2026</p>\n<p>a)Called Sunil Sir to check about Mirror Pay/Tranzovia website status, he said this task has come to him, need to call Anand Sir number was switched off need to follow up with him.<br>b) Call Anand Sir to check number for Utilorapay.<br>a) Follow up with client (Mirror Pay) via WhatsApp -Awaiting update from the relevant team regarding the website status. Will message the client on WhatsApp as soon as details are confirmed.<br>b) Had discussion with Siddharth Sir took help regarding (list of active/inactive and reason for inactive clients) Compiling Customer Status Report (Active vs. Inactive Accounts) PayPlex &amp; TechPlex.</p>', 63, 22, 0, 0, '2026-07-30 11:06:14'),
(17, '<p>Task given by Anand Sir to follow up with Radha Kanta and contact 2 clients (Mirror Pay/Tranzovia and ZENFIT TECHNOLOGY PRIVATE LIMITED) to take website development details.<br>a)Followed up with 1 client (Radha Kanta) regarding ongoing IT issues (technical issue acknowledged; shared revised timeline).<br>b) Contacted 2 clients to request domain details as website deployment - Received details from one client shared with Sir and another one Sir said he will pick.<br>c) Completed daily product training and knowledge enhancement activities.</p>', 63, 22, 0, 0, '2026-07-30 11:13:24'),
(18, '<p>Task done for 30/07/2026</p>\n<p>a) Contacted - Zenfit Technology Private Limited - customer disconnected the call, messaged in whatsup - as require more details about utilities website work which is in progress - Waiting for a response.<br>b) Call Anand Sir but unsuccessful, therefore Connected via whatsup, to inform spoken to Sunil Sir regarding Mirror Pay/Tranzovia website status but he said he has not received this. Informed Anand Sir and asked what needs to be done as client is following up on this - Waiting for a response.<br>c) Checked CBS TechPlex Modules and Features:<br>1) Transaction Reports - Transaction Report - transaction reports to verify transaction accuracy, status, and data consistency.<br>2) Customer Enrollment -Add Customer Bank Details -Verified and updated customer bank account information in the system, ensuring all details were accurate and complete.<br>3) Accounting - Reports -<br>Profit &amp; Loss Account - Checked the Profit &amp; Loss Account to verify income, expenses, and financial summary.<br>Balance Mismatch Verification &#160; &#160;Investigated balance mismatches by comparing ledger balances and identifying discrepancies.<br>Balance Sheet - Reviewed the Balance Sheet to verify assets, liabilities, and equity balances.<br>General Ledger - Examined General Ledger entries to ensure correct posting and accounting accuracy.<br>Cash Book - Verified cash book transactions and reconciled cash balances.<br>Bank Book - Reviewed bank book entries and reconciled bank transactions with system records.<br>Trial Balance - Checked the Trial Balance to ensure debit and credit balances were correctly matched.<br>4) Tools - Add Standing Instructions -Standing Instructions - Reviewed and configured standing instructions for scheduled transactions and recurring payments.<br>5) Accounting - GL Transactions - Contra Entry - Reviewed and verified contra entries for internal fund transfers between cash and bank accounts and Journal Entry - Checked journal entries for correct accounting adjustments and ledger postings.</p>', 63, 22, 0, 0, '2026-07-30 18:55:25'),
(19, '<p>-Followed up with Sunil on Current query status - Membership Details updation and previous queries status addressed on 16/07/26 -<br>a.RD/ FD &#160;pay out cannot approve voucher while transferring from RD/ FD &#160;Account to member saving &#160;account, whether it is cash &#160;or transfer.<br>b.Cannot update membership:- a) Asking to fill up guardian member ID and Name , compulsorily for adult and minor. Request to make it compulsory only for minor up to 10 years of age.<br>c.Single phone cannot be added to another member.&#160;<br>d.Recently while creating a joint account only 2 member can be added. Request to give an option to add 3 members.<br>e.Request to make a separate option to update Saving Account.<br>f.Request to resolve it to create loan account both &#8216;With Emi&#8221; and &#8216;Without Emi&#8221;.<br>g.Collector name cannot be create. Request to give an option to create a collector name. - This option comes when Applying for Loan.<br>Informed the client (Radha Kanta) that the issues are under process and will take some time to be resolved for the Previous queries status and current query we will update shortly.</p>\n<p>- Praveen Sir (a Client from Payplex) contacted wanted to talk to Siddharth Sir, advised we will check and informed Siddharth Sir.</p>\n<p>Recharge Staff E-Wallet: Processed and verified staff E-Wallet recharge requests and related transactions.<br>Member Card Request: Handled member card requests and verified the required member details for processing.<br>FD (Fixed Deposit): Practiced and verified FD account creation, deposit processing, maturity, and related transactions.<br>RD (Recurring Deposit): Worked on RD account creation, installment-related processes, maturity, and transaction verification.<br>Customer Enrolment: Completed customer/member enrolment and verified required details for generating Member IDs and creating accounts.<br>Membership Edition/Updation: Updated and verified existing member details, including required profile and membership information.</p>', 64, 22, 0, 0, '2026-08-19 10:38:17');
